*> vybe-test: cobol/divide_forms/test_divide_remainder_into
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_divide_forms.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-DIVISOR PIC 9(3) VALUE 5.
01 WS-DIVIDEND PIC 9(3) VALUE 17.
01 WS-QUOTIENT PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-REMAINDER PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DIVIDE WS-DIVISOR INTO WS-DIVIDEND GIVING WS-QUOTIENT REMAINDER WS-REMAINDER.
    DISPLAY WS-QUOTIENT.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-QUOTIENT DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "003"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [003] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-REMAINDER.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-REMAINDER DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "002"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [002] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

